    'Action; V/S/F; instantaneous private bearing. NEW: Self is the recipient, and the printed five-mile sensing limit controls instead of Core’s generic 60-foot target metadata. Designate one actual specific creature through personal acquaintance or a reliable identity description intended to identify one individual. A creature type or vague wanted category is not a search. At resolution, if that continuing creature exists on your plane within 26,400 feet and its location is readable, privately learn direction with meaningful vertical bearing. No save. Ordinary walls and originating line of effect do not block this express remote sense. Disguise or shapechange preserving identity does not replace the target. An active Undead or Construct can qualify as a creature; a corpse, destroyed entity or ended summon does not. Ambiguity, nonexistence, protection, range or plane mismatch all give No Bearing without stating why. This is one snapshot: movement after resolution is not tracked. Learn no distance, coordinates, room, route, condition, companions, destination sight or new plane relationship. A new legal paid inquiry can give a new snapshot without a mark or prior local encounter.',
